// Beats:
//   1. Import 49 modular KG embedding, GNN message passing, pooling, random walk, and spectral submodules.
//   2. Re-export public layer constructors, scoring functions, and graph transformation shims.
//   3. Maintain uniform type access and backwards compatibility for openOODA graph applications.

